invariant: INV-41
file: rsa_ifma_sign.c
catches: rsa_ifma_sign_model_test
reason: table_select's test of an entry adds 16 where it should add 15,
  so every entry reads as one the digit does not name, the mask keeps
  none, and each step multiplies by zero. bin/rsa_ifma_sign_model_test
  compares each exponentiation with rsa_sign64.c's window.

--- old
            uint64_t differ = ((entry ^ digit) + (TABLE_ENTRIES - 1)) >> WINDOW_BITS;
--- new
            uint64_t differ = ((entry ^ digit) + TABLE_ENTRIES) >> WINDOW_BITS;
